# atomic file


this was originally copied from

https://github.com/containerd/containerd/blob/main/pkg%2Fatomicfile/file.go


see

https://github.com/caddyserver/certmagic/issues/296


local modifications on top of the containerd version:

- Close verifies the synced temp file against a SHA-256 checksum of
  everything written before renaming it over the destination
- Close syncs the containing directory after the rename so the rename
  itself is durable across crashes
- temp files are named `.<dest>.tmp-*` so orphans left by a crash are
  recognizable, and new writers remove stale ones (bounded cleanup)
- Cancel is idempotent and tolerates an already-removed temp file
